{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, move to it, take, check properties, do task. Otherwise, scan or move randomly. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Action ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
